---
radar-beta
accTitle: Illustrative radar relationships
accDescr: Synthetic records for Intake, Review, Build and Release. Values are illustrative and make no measured performance claim.
axis i["Intake"], r["Review"], b["Build"], l["Release"]
curve before["Before"]{18,14,24,10}
curve after["After"]{12,8,16,6}
max 24
min 0
showLegend true
